{
  "_comment": [
    "One table, two implementations. jarvis-core's `permits()` in",
    "integrations/code/forges.py decides whether a clone is allowed; the",
    "console copies the rule into `whyNotProject` so the form can refuse",
    "without a round trip. A copy that drifts is worse than no copy, because",
    "the form would accept what the server then rejects and the reader would",
    "blame the form. Both suites read THIS file, so drift breaks whichever",
    "side moved."
  ],
  "cases": [
